  "heading_latex": "\\textrm{Multiplicativity and Triangle Inequality for the Complex Modulus}",
  "body_text": null,
  "page": null,
  "source": "Theorem:\ngiven: z, w is \\complex\nthen:\n. \\complex.modulus(z \\.complex.*./ w) = \\complex.modulus(z) \\.real.*./ \\complex.modulus(w)\n. \\complex.modulus(z \\.complex.+./ w) \\:real.leq?:/ \\complex.modulus(z) \\.real.+./ \\complex.modulus(w)\nDocumented:\n. called: \"Multiplicativity and Triangle Inequality for the Complex Modulus\"\n. description: \"The complex modulus is multiplicative and subadditive.\"\nId: \"d366bd62-6a88-4090-9613-ac5843473195\"",
